OL,3,GNEWSABurst water main hits homes and
OL,4,Acloses schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome homes are without water or have
OL,7,Flow pressure and schools have been
OL,8,Fforced to close in parts of Surrey
OL,9,Fafter an outage caused by a "large
OL,10,Fburst water main".
OL,12,FThames Water said it was investigating
OL,13,Fthe issue, first reported at about
OL,14,F05:15 BST, affecting Thames Ditton,
OL,15,FEsher, and Sunbury, plus other parts of
OL,16,Fthe county and South West London.
OL,18,FLong Ditton Infant and Nursery School
OL,19,Fand Thames Ditton Infant School said on
OL,20,Ftheir websites they had closed for the
OL,21,Fday as they were without a supply.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
