OL,3,GNEWSABurst water main hits homes and
OL,4,Acloses schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the water company
OL,7,Fapologised to customers, adding it
OL,8,Fwould "likely take some time to fix",
OL,9,Fbut that water for some properties was
OL,10,Fbeing re-routed.
